            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Megha"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great cocktail, really potent too! Got happy high after just 2 of these! Didn't have premade limeade so added lemon concentrate and powdered sugar. Perfect for a girly afternoon!",
            "datePublished": "2015-08-09T02:38:49.230Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
