            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "APJrz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is always a hit at summer parties. I usually use a light beer with lime like Bud or Miller Light with lime. I also use Raspberry vodka and raspberry lemonade. It's a little sweeter and lighter on a hot summer day.",
            "datePublished": "2013-07-13T12:43:08.283Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
